Project Name
An Exploratory Data Analysis and Machine Learning Study of Google Play App Store Applications

Business Questions
1.	Can we predict whether an app will receive a rating higher or equal to 4.0?
2.	How many installs can an app potentially achieve?
3.	What categories of apps have similar profiles?

Raw Data
Dataset 1: Google Play Store Apps - Data of 10k Play Store apps for analysing the Android market.
Author: Lavanya
File link: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/lava18/google-play-store-apps

Dataset 2: Google Play Store Apps - Google Play Store App data of 2.3 Million+ applications.
Author: Gautham Prakash
File link: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/gauthamp10/google-playstore-apps

